     "Update accumulators: $C_{acc} \\leftarrow C_{acc} + (1 - \\alpha_{acc}) c \\alpha_{corr}$ and $\\alpha_{acc} \\leftarrow \\alpha_{acc} + (1 - \\alpha_{acc}) \\alpha_{corr}$.",
